  Key Nomenclature Mapping Established:
  - mesh → model (vgg19, convnext_large, wide_resnet101_2) NOT dataset
  - chains → trials/samples (parallel HPO trials)
  - tinydaIterations → epochs (training epochs per trial)
  - workflowIterations → optimization rounds (HPO refinement iterations)
