CRITICAL FIX: STEEP WORKFLOW ENGINE INTEGRATION (Session 2)
================================================================================

PROBLEM IDENTIFIED:
- executor_HPO.py was BYPASSING the Steep workflow engine
- Directly instantiating CloudRunnerHPO (hard-coded cloud-only)
- Lost all Steep features: ForEach iterations, service abstraction, on-prem support
- Violated DRY principle (different execution model from SeisSol)

ROOT CAUSE:
- Confused "dedicated executor architecture" with "bypass workflow engine"
- These are SEPARATE concerns that should not be conflated

CORRECT UNDERSTANDING:
- Dedicated executor = WHERE executor runs (separate instance)
- Steep workflow engine = HOW workflows execute (same as SeisSol)
- The two concepts are independent and compatible!

